  "source_text": "Hi! I think we're neighbors. I've just moved in next door. Oh, hi! Welcome to the building. When did you move in? On Saturday. There are boxes everywhere! How long have you lived here? For about three years. It's a quiet building, and the neighbors are really friendly. Where did you live before? Downtown. It was fun, but so noisy. I know what you mean. I used to live there too, and I couldn't sleep! I think this area is much better. That's good to hear. Is there a gym near here? Yes, there's one near the metro station. It's small, but it's cheap. Do you like running? The park five minutes away is great for that. I do! I run on weekends. Me too. And I think the bakery on the corner is the best in the area. You should try their bread. Thanks, I will! Well, I'll let you get back to your boxes. Let me know if you need anything. That's very kind. Nice to meet you!",
  "source_turns": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Hi! I think we're neighbors. I've just moved in next door."
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Oh, hi! Welcome to the building. When did you move in?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "On Saturday. There are boxes everywhere! How long have you lived here?"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "For about three years. It's a quiet building, and the neighbors are really friendly. Where did you live before?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Downtown. It was fun, but so noisy."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "I know what you mean. I used to live there too, and I couldn't sleep! I think this area is much better."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "That's good to hear. Is there a gym near here?"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Yes, there's one near the metro station. It's small, but it's cheap. Do you like running? The park five minutes away is great for that."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "I do! I run on weekends."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Me too. And I think the bakery on the corner is the best in the area. You should try their bread."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Thanks, I will!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Well, I'll let you get back to your boxes. Let me know if you need anything."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "That's very kind. Nice to meet you!"
    }
  ],
